# m6_retry: the RETRY shield in a normal game. m2_play's input (the sweep to 3960 with its two
# holds) plus RIGHT 3670..3720. The sweep cannot live through stage 1 in a normal game, so it
# collects the shield in god mode (debug_god at 31; god never consumes the shield) and god
# goes off again at 3520, in the Heisenbug's fight (no hit lands in the 200 ticks before, so
# every rewind replays from a god-free keyframe).
# Re-pinned for the catch-up clock (the stage-1 boss now comes at 2823, and from 5000, the old
# god-off point, a rewind replayed god-mode hits): god off moved from 5000 to 3520 and the
# RIGHT from 5150..5200 to 3670..3720, the run from 5700 to 4200 updates.
# - 1687: the retry crate is grabbed, shield 0 -> 1.
# - 3780 (game tick 3673): the ship is hit with the shield up. The shield takes it inside the
#   simulation: shield 1 -> 0, state stays 1 (PLAYING, no REWIND), rewinds stay 3, fuel 180
#   untouched (m6_retry_hc shows the fuel side where a hit would cost it), and 60 ticks of
#   invulnerability.
# - 3840 (tick 3733): the boss's fire again, unshielded, so a normal hit: REWIND, rewinds
#   3 -> 2, target 3613 (hit - 120). During the playback the world goes back past the
#   absorbing hit, so at 3890 (tick 3671) the shield is up again; the resume at 3920 (tick
#   3613) keeps it and charges the M7 power loss (B5 -> B4, forks 3 -> 2, mercy 80). The ship
#   meets the same fire again and the shield absorbs it at 3980 (tick 3673 once more),
#   rewinds still 2. The next real hit is at 4040 (tick 3733, rewinds 1).
# debug_history_check is 0 right after the absorbing hit, through the invulnerability and
# after the resume (2 on the bug-report frames, 3840..3859, by design).
--frames 4200 --call-at "31 debug_god" --call-at "3520 debug_god" --dump-exports debug_state,debug_shield,debug_rewinds,debug_fuel,debug_lives --at "1686 debug_shield == 0" --at "1687 debug_shield == 1" --at "3779 debug_shield == 1" --at "3779 debug_rewinds == 3" --at "3780 debug_game_tick == 3673" --at "3780 debug_shield == 0" --at "3780 debug_state == 1" --at "3780 debug_rewinds == 3" --at "3780 debug_fuel == 180" --at "3781 debug_history_check == 0" --at "3810 debug_history_check == 0" --at "3839 debug_state == 1" --at "3839 debug_rewinds == 3" --at "3839 debug_lives == 3" --at "3840 debug_state == 4" --at "3840 debug_rewinds == 2" --at "3840 debug_rewind_target == 3613" --at "3889 debug_shield == 0" --at "3890 debug_shield == 1" --at "3920 debug_state == 1" --at "3920 debug_game_tick == 3613" --at "3920 debug_shield == 1" --at "3920 debug_weapon == 24" --at "3920 debug_forks == 2" --at "3920 debug_mercy == 80" --at "3930 debug_history_check == 0" --at "3979 debug_shield == 1" --at "3980 debug_shield == 0" --at "3980 debug_game_tick == 3673" --at "3980 debug_state == 1" --at "3980 debug_rewinds == 2" --at "3990 debug_history_check == 0" --at "4039 debug_state == 1" --at "4040 debug_state == 4" --at "4040 debug_rewinds == 1" --expect "debug_rewinds == 1"
